<title>FRANCE: EU cuts durum groat/meal refund to five Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU cuts durum groat/meal refund to five Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the standing refund for exports of durum groats and meal to five Ecus per tonne from nine Ecus, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The refund covers material with an ash content of less than 1,300 milligrammes per 100 grammes through a 0.16 millimetre sieve.</p>
</text>
